[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That can't be..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの？\u3000具合悪い？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you okay? You don't look so good."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、残念なのは分かるけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I get that you're disappointed, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門。二人には話しておいたほうがよいのではなくて？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon. Don't you think you should tell them?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ええ。分かっておりまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes. You're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何よ、話って？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell us what?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……と、いうわけなのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So that's the situation."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "年が明けたらって……そんな急な話……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After the new year?! That's so sudden...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "始めたばっかりなのに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we're just getting started..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、本当にすまない。\nだが、やむにやまれぬ事情ゆえ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm so sorry, both of you. But the circumstances leave me no choice..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、家庭の事情ならしょうがないんじゃないの……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, if it's a family matter, what can you do..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お父さん、良くなるといいね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope your father gets better soon..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本来ならば、今度のフェスで花道を飾ろうと\n思っていたのだが……それも叶わなくなってしまったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'd hoped we could go out on a high note at the festival... but that's not going to happen now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ社長！\u3000どうにかならないの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, isn't there something we can do?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうよ！\u3000辞めるのは仕方なかったとしても……\nこのまま何もなく終わるなんて嫌よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly! If you have to leave, fine... but we can't just let it end like this with nothing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも……ありがとう。\nその気持ちだけで拙者は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two... thank you. Just knowing you feel that way is enough for me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたも！\u3000なに最初から諦めてんのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, stop that! Don't go giving up before we've even tried!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ええ。わたくしも同じ気持ちですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I feel the same way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシたちだけでもちゃんとライブとかできないかな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can't we still put on a proper live show, even just the three of us?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "会場の確保は難しいかもしれないけど……\nネット配信って手もあるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Finding a venue might be tough... but there's always a livestream."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、そちらは最終手段ですわね。\nそれよりもまずは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would be a last resort. Before we get to that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Before that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話を付けてきますわ。すぐに戻ります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm going to go have a word with someone. I'll be back shortly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "社長殿！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにする気かしら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is she up to..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No idea...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]